WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.965
The veteran-to-MAID pipeline.

00:00:01.965 --> 00:00:07.329
Inadequate transition, denied claims, impossible wait times, and then an offer of death.

00:00:07.329 --> 00:00:10.522
The government's own data documents every link in this chain.

00:00:10.522 --> 00:00:12.295
This is not random failure.

00:00:12.295 --> 00:00:13.897
It is a connected pipeline.
